  "description": "The Davitt is a development of 1- and 2-bedroom homes, located adjacent to Goldenbridge Luas Stop and overlooking the Grand Canal.\r\n\r\nThe development is the next standard in rental accommodation offering luxurious and stylish furnishings while conveniently set 15 minutes from Dublin City Centre and sights to enjoy such as The War Memorial Garden, Kilmainham Gaol, Good Council GAA Club and Phoenix Park to name a few. The area is surrounded by a host of local coffee shops and restaurants such as the Lime Tree Café, Café de Cuba and The Black Forge. The Davitt is also located less than a 20-minute drive to Liffey Valley and Blanchardstown Shopping Centres. \r\n\r\nThe complex offers generously sized 1 bedroom pet-friendly apartments set within beautiful courtyards. The apartment is finished to an extremely high specification and some of these features include: \r\n\r\n•\tComplimentary Wi-Fi and television package\r\n•\tHigh-quality interior finishes and bespoke furniture packs\r\n•\tFloor to ceiling windows\r\n•\tIntegrated Kitchens with modern appliances\r\n•\tLuxury bathrooms and en-suites \r\n•\tSeparate utility room with generous storage \r\n•\tSpacious balconies / winter gardens\r\n•\tVideo intercom \r\n•\tUnderground parking and secure bicycle storage\r\n•\tExcellent energy rating A2-A3 and air source heat pumps for hot water and heating\r\n•\tLandscaped Gardens with outdoor seating spaces\r\n\r\nThe communal resident amenity space is second to none and will offer residents exceptional enjoyment whether it’s using the Chefs Kitchen, Lounge Area or state of the art Business Centre. The amenity space includes:\r\n\r\n•\tConcierge/Residents Manager\r\n•\t‘Bring Me’ Parcel Collection Service\r\n•\tState of the Art Gym\r\n•\tResidents Lounge & Library\r\n•\tToddlers Play Area\r\n•\tBusiness Centre (with bookable private rooms and open plan workspaces)\r\n•\tBookable Lounge with chef’s kitchen\r\n•\tBookable Guest Rooms\r\n•\tMedia/Cinema Room\r\n•\tChildren’s Playground",
